WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:04.779
[noisy crowd] Good afternoon.
[drums beating] Do come in. My name is Sir

cue-2
00:00:04.779 --> 00:00:10.739
Commodity Taxom, and I have the honor to
be one of the two candidates standing for

cue-3
00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:16.739
the new interest. Pick up a cockade, pin
it to your hat. Orange, that's our

cue-4
00:00:16.739 --> 00:00:17.739
campaign color.

cue-5
00:00:18.459 --> 00:00:24.539
Suits your complexion beautifully, if I
may say so. Take a seat. Have some

cue-6
00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:27.459
champagne. Gin? Punch?

cue-7
00:00:28.639 --> 00:00:35.520
What do we stand for? Liberty and loyalty.
You can see it on our flag. But just look

cue-8
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:40.880
at these people. They care more about how
much food and drink they can shovel down

cue-9
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:47.799
their throats. Wine, oysters, tobacco. Do
you have any idea how much this is

cue-10
00:00:47.799 --> 00:00:54.599
costing me? It's illegal to bribe voters
with money, you see, so I must treat them

cue-11
00:00:54.599 --> 00:00:58.880
with a banquet like this. [glass clinks]
Or with gifts for their wives and

cue-12
00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:05.879
daughters. I owe that sour-looking man 20
pounds for all those gloves

cue-13
00:01:05.879 --> 00:01:12.680
and stockings on the table. Believe me, I
loathe being here among these

cue-14
00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:19.339
awful people. Oh, I apologize. Not you, of
course. But when there's an election, I

cue-15
00:01:19.339 --> 00:01:25.839
need to show willing. If I want this man's
vote, I'm obliged to kiss his wife, even

cue-16
00:01:25.839 --> 00:01:30.019
if he is setting fire to my wig. Have a
care, sir.

cue-17
00:01:30.959 --> 00:01:37.800
Will it be worth it? Well, if I get
elected into Parliament, that's influence

cue-18
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:44.739
and money for me. And yes, if enough of us
whigs win, we'll be able to keep those

cue-19
00:01:44.739 --> 00:01:51.540
Tories out of government. But Lord, the
indignity. And this

cue-20
00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:54.040
is only the start of the campaign.
